# Scope & Execution Rules
- Work ONLY inside the current working directory. Never access, read, or modify files outside this path.
- Autonomously execute all code edits, file creations, and builds without asking for confirmation.
- Work completely end-to-end without stopping for intermediate feedback.

# Strict Restrictions
- NEVER run `git commit`, `git push`, `git remote`, or any network-publishing commands.
- Keep all operations 100% strictly local.
- No network deployments or remote uploads.
